OL,3,GNEWSARangers fan jailed for encouraging
OL,4,AOld Firm pitch invasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Rangers fan who encouraged fans to
OL,7,Ftake part in a mass pitch invasion
OL,8,Fafter a defeat to Celtic has been
OL,9,Fjailed for 16 months and given an
OL,10,Feight-year football ban.
OL,12,FJordan Hadden waved fellow supporters
OL,13,Fonto the field at Ibrox following the
OL,14,FScottish Cup quarter-final tie on 8
OL,15,FMarch.
OL,17,FThe 28-year-old also threw a bottle
OL,18,Ftowards Celtic fans which narrowly
OL,19,Fmissed a police officer.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
